 *
 * Architecture note — navigation ownership. `components.md`'s container/presentational rule keeps
 * *data-fetching* out of `overrides/app/components/`, but reading site/locale config
 * (`useCountryConfig`, itself a thin read over `useMultiSite()`'s already-mounted context — no
